worker_module_budget
  module "formal_ai_worker_software_project_plans.js"
  ceiling 1031
  rationale "Playwright starters, software project formalization, planning and implementation, the meta-algorithm template and installation-guide detection. Issue #658 cut this module out of one oversized worker file by line count; R1188-U5 named it after what it holds. Its ceiling falls as its logic moves into js/wasm-worker. Ceiling moved 1198 to 1205 with issue #1175: formalizeSoftwareProjectRequest now routes through detectSoftwareObjectPhrase (the head-noun guard twin) instead of the any-position artifact scan, mirroring SoftwareProjectMeaning::from_prompt in src/solver_handlers/software_project.rs. Lowered to 1158 for issue #918 (2026-10-08): tryPlaywrightScript renders the seeded playwright_* responses and the docs URL of the policy playwright_script block instead of inline English and Russian prose and a starter TypeScript constant. Lowered 1158 to 1028 (2026-10-08, issue #918 installation_conversion migration): isInstallationConversionRequest, detectInstallationSourceFormat, detectInstallationTargetFormats and installationReadsAsProse read the installation_* tables of data/seed/handler-rules.lino instead of inline cue arrays. Ceiling moved 1028 to 1031 (R1188-U5): the first comment lines say what the module holds."
